+// against Lucky13 attacks on CBC-mode encryption, and only on SHA1
+// variants. See http://www.isg.rhul.ac.uk/tls/TLStiming.pdf and
+// https://www.imperialviolet.org/2013/02/04/luckythirteen.html.
